# Security Rules

- Validate and sanitize external input before use.
- Never use `eval` or dynamic `Function` on untrusted data.
- Do not construct shell commands from user-controlled strings.
- Block path traversal in file paths built from user input.
- No API keys or tokens in source control — use local env or a secret manager.
